WEBVTT

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:02.800
Come here quickly!

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.020
Come here immediately!

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:05.720
Let the three of us play 'til we drop!

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:18.020
Say bye-bye to the teacher after class!

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:20.530
And bring back your gym clothes!

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:25.400
Wanna gather at the schoolyard to play?

00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:28.160
Aren't you gonna give a good excuse?

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:30.710
Just leave that homework alone!

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:35.700
Let's swing around the metal bars instead!

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:40.770
That red backpack sure is strong

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:43.350
One, two, line up in threes!

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:45.880
And dash forward with the pencil case after school!

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:50.950
You'll forget about it, so cheer up!

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:50.950
One

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:50.950
Two!

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:53.470
Hey Mr.! Turn around that corner!

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:57.760
Let's have a large assembly in the schoolyard!

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:00.100
Just who am I?

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:05.990
Can I still have fun when I grow up?

00:01:05.990 --> 00:01:10.700
I don't know, but I just wanna know!

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:16.060
If we can still laugh over the small matters

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:20.660
I'm happy enough with that!

00:01:20.690 --> 00:01:23.340
This! That! And everything else!

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:28.200
Let the three of us play 'til we drop!

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:36.030
A Day at the Marui House

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:39.070
I'm heading out!

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:40.530
I'm leaving now.

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:44.040
Don't you think that it'd be better to take the day off?

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:48.000
I'll go...

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:51.920
Because... fifth period is gym class...

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:55.920
Come straight home if you're not feeling well.

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:58.430
Okay...

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:00.600
Make sure you dress up warmly enough.

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:03.680
Well then.

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:17.860
Fu...Futa-

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:19.700
Good morning, Third Daughter!

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:24.120
Wow, your aura's greater than usual today!

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:24.990
Hey...

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:31.750
Geez, her aura sure can make one tremble with fear!

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:34.500
Hey, Chiba! Third Daughter's behind you!

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.460
Huh?  Where?

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:38.470
Right behind you! Just right there!

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:40.340
It's just some spirit or something, right?

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:42.600
Shouldn't you be more troubled by that?

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:43.470
A spirit?!

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:44.390
Where?! Where is it?!

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:45.720
N-No, that's not it...

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:51.100
I-Is that really Futaba?

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:53.610
Your cold's getting worse!

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:55.780
Let me write sutras all over you!

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:57.400
You just keep out of this.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:58.740
You can't go to the gym like that.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:01.450
I will...!

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:05.030
This must be Third Daughter, after all!

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:06.870
That's kinda rude.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.870
Maybe I should just go home.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:18.800
See!

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:22.050
The only one that Nipples ever goes to is Third Daughter!

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:23.220
But, Third Daughter is-

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:29.100
Th-There are two of them?!

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:32.560
You can't see her without her aura?!

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:34.610
That was weak!

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:36.570
F-Futaba?!

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:44.820
T-That can't be...!

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:48.160
This one collapsed as well!

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:51.410
L-Let's take them both to the infirmary straight away!

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:56.250
A...

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:56.920
...full recovery!

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:59.340
A little sleep is all I need!

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:00.800
You're really simple, aren't you?

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:01.840
Where's Third Daughter?

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:04.550
She actually got a fever and was sent home.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:06.390
Did you pass it to her?

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:07.890
Hold up...

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:11.100
If Futaba became like that from the cold,

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:13.600
what will happen if Third Daughter catches it?!

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:16.610
She might get the ability to curse anyone by sight!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:19.440
Hito...

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:20.860
Cover yourselves!

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:30.700
Are you alright, Hitoha?

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:34.250
W-Who is this chick?!

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.500
Whoa!

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:38.500
P-Please be my friend!

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:40.000
I beg you!

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.010
Colds are really scary...

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.270
Is this the cat you talked about yesterday?

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:55.690
We are feeding him everyday.

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:56.940
Yeah.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:05:00.610
Let's try convincing Papa again to let us keep it!

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:02.440
It's not going to work.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:08.620
It just said, 'I want to live with the Maruis, nya~'

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:10.080
No, it didn't!

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:14.290
If you were to bring home a cat,

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:16.870
you might hurt it by accident, right?

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:18.540
See? Told ya!

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:20.540
It's not going to work!

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.250
It'll be fine!

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:27.840
Also, the cat said, 'I want to live with the Maruis, nya~'

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:29.350
No, it didn't!

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:32.060
I guess we'll have to keep it, if that's the case.

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:32.850
Really?!

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:35.680
Hey, wait!

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:37.480
Hurray! We did it!

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.610
It didn't say anything at all!

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:41.020
It did.

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:42.940
W-What?!

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:44.740
Do whatever you want, then!

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.240
The Following Day

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:48.320
We bought too much!

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:50.490
Why do I have to do all this for that cat?!

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:53.990
You keep complaining, but still helped us out.

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:56.500
I-I just wanted to kill some time!

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:05.920
T-The cat's gone!

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:07.260
Even the cardboard box as well...

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:11.890
I-I'm sure some kind person picked it up!

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:19.940
Hitoha...

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:49.800
Do something about this!

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:50.630
Like what?!

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:52.300
I got it!

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:01.190
One pet is enough for the Marui family!

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:09.490
Wow, it's saying, 'please train me to be your personal slave!'

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:11.360
I did not!

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:12.240
You fool!

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:14.490
Don't just return to your original form like that!

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:19.080
Let's try this.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:19.870
Here, kitty!

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:21.870
This is really fun!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:22.750
Here, come on!

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:30.260
Just die!

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:32.010
Go die, you meowing oaf...!

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:39.180
Stop!

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:41.310
You are making a mess! Quit it already!

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:45.810
She has completely turned into a cat.

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:12.880
What's wrong with you, completely ignoring me?!

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:14.930
Weren't you originally my pet?!

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:17.680
Come now!

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:18.470
Shake hands!

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:21.020
Cats don't shake hands.

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:25.480
Gotta find something that works...

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:26.560
This is it!

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:29.610
Special technique!

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:30.900
Catnip powder!

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:43.580
How's that?!

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:47.000
I've won! She is my pet, after all!

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:48.840
I'm home!

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:55.430
H-How did you...?!

00:08:55.840 --> 00:09:00.430
I just happened to pass by the river on my way back from work and picked it up.

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:04.600
But I was arrested three times on the way and got back late.

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:12.440
Aren't you happy?

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:14.900
You're so heavy! It hurts!

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:15.900
Stop it already!

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:18.660
You're both getting along so well today.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.910
I don't want this kind of pet!

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:27.670
Squadron of sincerity!

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:28.790
Gachi Rangers!

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:29.960
Shine!

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:33.510
Fly!

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:37.760
Taking down monsters is just a cinch with this!

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:42.140
Squadron of sincerity, Gachi Rangers!

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:44.930
The action model of the Red Gachi Ranger!

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:50.440
The action model!

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:58.240
The action model of Gachi Red!

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:00.070
Geez, you bought something like that again.

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:01.830
You're really childish, Hitoha.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:08.080
The belt just lit up!

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:13.920
The head just flew up!

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:22.680
Oh, Kitty, stop-

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:43.990
This week is the nerve-wrecking home-visiting week!

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:46.330
A strong link between school and family

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.960
is vital for a proper education!

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:50.500
Well, that aside,

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:53.040
I'm on my way to the biggest hurdle in my career, the Marui House.

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:55.210
Who knows what could happen...

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:00.050
What the heck is with that aura?!

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:02.850
I don't wanna go!

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:11.060
Erm, where is your father?

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:12.310
He's at work.

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:15.860
What?! Did you tell him about the home-visit?!

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:18.780
I told him to come home by 5 o'clock this morning.

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:20.110
This morning...

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:22.990
Well, can't help it if he's busy...

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:24.870
But you could have told me to come at a better time.

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:26.490
There is no such time.

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:28.500
This is an important home-visit, you know!

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:30.830
How impudent of you.

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:33.710
I'm seriously going to get angry.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:37.500
By the way, where are Mitsuba and Futaba?

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:38.630
I do not know.

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:41.800
I can only wait another ten minutes, okay?!

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:44.340
Are you going to impose for another ten minutes?!

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:47.560
I want to go back right away...

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:48.680
Be my guest.

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:50.810
Don't read my mind!

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:07.830
Uh...

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:09.580
Hm?! What is it?!

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:12.410
I'm bored. Mind if I turn on the TV?

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:14.630
Sure! Go ahead!

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:25.800
I have a dream!

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:28.680
I want to be a reliable teacher!

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:32.100
At times, I need to be strict with my students,

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:35.020
but I'm sure they will admire me one day!

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:37.400
Just hold right there, Yabecchi!

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:40.320
That will never happen!

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:43.780
'He's a bum and good-for-nothing servant!'

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:45.490
That's what Micchan told me!

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:46.870
Turn that damn TV off!!

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:48.280
I'm timid-

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:53.710
A kitty!

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:55.460
You keep cats, eh?

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:57.830
I love cats, you know!

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:00.130
Nyan! Here, here, nyan!

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:09.600
The damn police made me late again.

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:13.390
I wonder why she wanted me to be back by five.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:15.520
You're so cute!

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:17.770
You're so docile, too!

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:19.560
It's a man's voice!

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:20.770
W-Who is it?!

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:23.530
Aww, it feels so nice!

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:24.530
Wait, stop it-

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:26.860
It's incredibly soft here!

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:28.910
Don't touch there!

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:32.540
Who's that guy?!

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:34.580
Stop it already!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.120
Don't touch it!

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:37.210
Why not?

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:38.790
Let me touch it a bit more!

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:41.300
Please stop! Don't touch me!

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.800
Why not? It's no big deal!

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:48.140
That goddamned pervert!

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:49.300
I'm going to kill him!

00:13:57.890 --> 00:13:59.730
Wait, where are you going?

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:01.110
I've got homework to do.

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:03.650
Just leave the cat with me!

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:05.400
Please don't follow me!

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.360
I-Is that your father...?

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:27.670
T-That can't be your father... R-Right?!

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:33.970
A-A burglar?!

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:36.100
He's here to kill!

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:38.520
N-No... That's just...

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:51.870
It won't open!

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:57.950
No way! Here too?!

00:14:57.950 --> 00:14:59.830
Our room is the only one unlocked.

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.310
Uhh...

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:18.980
Listen up!

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:20.690
Hide under the covers!

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:21.600
It'll be okay!

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:23.060
I will protect you!

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:24.110
No, he's-

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:25.110
Just hide!

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:55.300
He's here!!!

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:03.730
Nooo!!!

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:06.690
I'm scared!!

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:13.570
F-Father!

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:14.820
Hitoha?!

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:16.120
Are you alright?!

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:17.660
Are you hurt?!

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:19.240
F-Father?!

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:22.620
So you were the father, eh?

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:25.880
Man, I thought you were a burglar...

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:31.260
If I am one, then what would <i>you</i> be?

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:35.140
N-No, this isn't what you think...

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:36.470
It's just...

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:37.890
Just...?

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:42.100
Hitoha?!

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:45.100
Wait! I'll explain!

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:48.150
I'm just Hitoha's homeroom teacher and I...!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:51.400
That's even worse!!!

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:56.410
Yes...

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:58.780
He's fine in class.

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:02.910
Just what happened at the triplets' house?

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:04.790
Well, I can more or less imagine...

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:16.430
Yabecchi's Room

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:13.550
That part of the episode was the worst.

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:15.590
Here we are at Yabecchi's Room again.

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:18.640
Marui's Third Daughter is our guest this time-

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:19.180
Eh?

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:20.470
Hitoha?

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:26.190
The hell! Why do you always pop up between my legs?!

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:27.520
It's just as promised.

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:30.820
It's bad for my heart! Just stop that already!

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:33.110
You didn't help me out just now-

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:32.440
Quiet down

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:41.830
Our guest for today is the Third Daughter from the Marui triplets, Marui Hitoha.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:48.250
Today's guest Marui Hitoha-san

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:44.790
What would you like to discuss today?

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:46.750
Time's up.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.250
That's all, folks.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:51.130
What?

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:54.510
Yabecchi's Room    End

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:05.180
Jackpot!

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:08.020
The third prize! Free passes to the amusement park!

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:12.360
Micchan!

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:14.440
It's the amusement park!

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:17.450
I've done it!

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:19.530
This is my golden era!

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:25.040
The grand prize! An all-expenses-paid trip to Hawaii!

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:26.410
Wow, that's just awesome!

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:29.290
First time I've seen someone winning the grand prize on their first try!

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:34.670
People can be lucky at times, eh?

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:38.550
Well, this is just normal for someone like me!

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:41.930
O-Only two passes?

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:43.640
Should I go with Futaba?

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:49.020
No way! I won't go if Papa doesn't go!

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:51.020
Then, with Hitoha...?

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:54.940
JET COASTER

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:54.070
There's no weight limit, so you can ride as well.

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:00.860
W-Wait...!

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:06.410
Don't move, or the gondola will drop!

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:10.080
I wouldn't be able to stand it...

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:13.750
Then again, she may not even be interested in them to begin with.

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.880
Amusement parks are for kids.

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:17.760
Just like your panties.

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:21.970
I look forward to going to the amusement park with you!

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:24.180
Y-You're fine with me?

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.310
Why not?

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:26.810
You don't want to go with me?

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:30.980
C-Can't be helped then!

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:32.520
I'll take you along with me,

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:33.940
but don't go running around the place too much, okay?

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:35.520
Alright!

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:38.030
Won from the lottery tombola, eh?

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:40.200
It's set for this coming Sunday.

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:42.160
Tokyo Dome Land, huh?

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:43.780
Yup, I will go with Futaba-

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:45.280
I want to go, too.

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:51.580
There is a Gachi Ranger show held in Tokyo Dome Land every weekend.

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:55.170
I can't wait to shake their hands and take pictures with them!

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:58.090
You're pretty well informed.

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:00.800
I've always wanted to go there,

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:02.050
so I checked it out.

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:03.680
I wanna handshake with 'em, too!

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:06.300
I wanna see Gachi Pink's big boobies as well!

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:12.100
I think I can afford another pass...

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:14.060
Oh yeah! I forgot!

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:14.900
Huh?

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:19.320
I-I have something on with Sugisaki this coming Sunday!

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:22.400
I need to go out with my servants occasionally,

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:25.990
so I'll let you kids go to the amusement park!

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:28.080
I was never interested in it anyway!

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:33.290
Eh?

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:34.790
The Following Day

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:37.920
Micchan, where are you going this Sunday with Sugisaki?

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:39.880
Erm, about that...

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:42.840
Micchan, you know, about these passes...

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:44.680
Hey, hey, listen up!

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:49.310
This coming Sunday, I'll be going on a day trip to Hokkaido.

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:53.180
How nice, going to Hokkaido!

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:56.190
W-Why are you saying that to her?!

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:58.020
Say that to me instead!

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:00.440
I'm looking forward to it!

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:01.820
Right?!

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:05.030
For your info, I won't get you any souvenirs.

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:08.200
For your info, we're not going to get you guys any souvenirs!

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:09.700
I heard her, alright.

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:12.200
S-She's twisting her words?!

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:15.290
There'll be crabs, potatoes, sea urchins and stuff, right?!

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:16.620
Right?!

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:17.500
What's with you?!

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:20.130
You're being more annoying than usual!

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:22.630
Take a look here.

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:29.510
These two passes are good for four people!

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:33.100
That's why, Futaba-

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:34.230
I got it!

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:37.440
There's me, you...  Since Micchan can't go,

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:39.270
we can have Papa and one more...

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:40.770
Shin!

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:42.440
Shin!

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:43.780
Oh, Futaba-

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:48.280
Shin, come with us to the amusement park this coming sunday!

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:50.370
Eh? What's with that all of a sudden?

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:51.950
Well, I'm fine with it, though...

00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:22.660
As the sun sets on the schoolyard

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:28.010
I waved my hand, and head back home

00:22:28.200 --> 00:22:33.110
Tonight, when I go to bed

00:22:33.250 --> 00:22:38.430
It'd be great if I can see you again

00:22:38.430 --> 00:22:43.710
Let's go to sleep

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:47.670
I can't wait for tomorrow

00:22:49.790 --> 00:22:54.400
It's really wonderful in my dream, you see...

00:22:54.800 --> 00:22:58.620
You can even fly into the sky

00:22:59.800 --> 00:23:12.550
My heart aches when I hold your hand, even in my dream

00:23:13.060 --> 00:23:18.000
Just like my dream-colored love

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:31.070
It's really wonderful in my dream, you see...

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:35.290
You can even fly into the sky
